cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Replication package: Identifiability and Confounding in Test-Adequacy Metric Validity Studies"
abstract: >-
  Collection pipeline, per-instance measurements and analysis code for a
  cross-language study of whether incremental-validity claims about
  test-adequacy metrics can be statistically resolved at conventional sample
  sizes, on Defects4J (Java) and BugsInPy (Python).
type: software
license: MIT
version: v1.0-submission
date-released: 2026-10-16
authors:
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "Junjie"
    affiliation: "Nanjing University of Science and Technology"
    email: "junjie_chen@njust.edu.cn"
message: >-
  If you use this replication package, please cite the accompanying paper.
